# Koleksi REST — Webhook OpenWA
#
# Endpoint ini dipanggil OpenWA, bukan klien mobile. Koleksi ini mensimulasikan kiriman OpenWA
# v4.76.0 untuk memeriksa keamanan, penyaringan event, dan idempotency tanpa menyalakan OpenWA.
#
# Bentuk body diambil dari rekaman nyata spike P0 (tests/fixtures/openwa/), disamarkan dan
# diringkas ke field yang dibaca server; payload asli berisi sekitar 100 field per pesan.
#
# RAHASIA ADA DI PATH, bukan di header: OpenWA v4 tidak bisa mengirim header kustom lewat -w.
# @webhookSecret harus sama dengan WEBHOOK_SECRET di .env (huruf, angka, "-", "_"). URL yang
# didaftarkan ke OpenWA: http://localhost:3000/webhooks/openwa/<WEBHOOK_SECRET>
#
# Hasil di database (npx prisma studio, tabel message_logs):
#   - 1: satu baris baru    - 2: tidak bertambah    - 3, 5-8: tidak ada baris baru
#   - 4b: satu baris baru, isi pesan asli (bukan ciphertext)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@webhookSecret = ganti-dengan-rahasia-acak-minimal-16-karakter

# Hanya untuk blok "Demo idempotency" di bawah (claude/DEMO-SCRIPT.md, langkah 9).
# @senderPhone: nomor yang SUDAH ditautkan lewat whatsapp.http, tanpa "+" (mis. 628123456789).
#   Server mengenali pengirim lewat data.sender.phoneNumber; nomor lain dijawab ajakan daftar.
# @demoRun: ubah (01 -> 02 -> ...) setiap kali demo diulang. data.id menjadi kunci idempotency,
#   jadi id yang sama dengan latihan sebelumnya dianggap kiriman ulang dan tidak diproses.
@senderPhone = 628123456789
@demoRun = 01

### ============================================================
### POST /webhooks/openwa/:rahasia
### ============================================================

# 1. Pesan chat pribadi: 204, satu baris message_logs (status received), satu job inbound.
#    Perhatikan: from/chatId berisi LID (...@lid), bukan nomor. Nomor ada di data.sender.phoneNumber.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ts": 1791151342627,
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "53c0ec2b-0afa-416b-ab1a-1575848e281f",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_AC0D70512C16BC6E88D19BAF13A5F557",
    "from": "111111111111111@lid",
    "to": "628987654321@c.us",
    "author": "111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "tadi makan siang 25 ribu",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "t": 1791151342,
    "notifyName": "Budi Santoso",
    "sender": {
      "id": "628123456789@c.us",
      "lid": "111111111111111@lid",
      "phoneNumber": "628123456789@c.us",
      "pushname": "Budi Santoso"
    }
  },
  "webhook_id": "9455fbeb-3a49-4b6c-afe3-0f3016191a2b"
}

### 2. Idempotency: kirim ulang body yang SAMA persis dengan nomor 1. Tetap 204; message_logs
###    tetap satu baris (unique session_id + wa_message_id) dan tidak ada job kedua.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ts": 1791151342627,
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "53c0ec2b-0afa-416b-ab1a-1575848e281f",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_AC0D70512C16BC6E88D19BAF13A5F557",
    "from": "111111111111111@lid",
    "to": "628987654321@c.us",
    "author": "111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "tadi makan siang 25 ribu",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "t": 1791151342,
    "notifyName": "Budi Santoso",
    "sender": {
      "id": "628123456789@c.us",
      "lid": "111111111111111@lid",
      "phoneNumber": "628123456789@c.us",
      "pushname": "Budi Santoso"
    }
  },
  "webhook_id": "9455fbeb-3a49-4b6c-afe3-0f3016191a2b"
}

### 3. OpenWA mengirim setiap pesan juga sebagai onAnyMessage (id pesan sama). Diabaikan: 204 tanpa efek.
###    Bila ini ikut diproses, setiap pesan tercatat dua kali.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ts": 1791151342630,
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "9d1b3c58-1f4e-4e0a-8f77-3b0f6c1d2a90",
  "event": "onAnyMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_AC0D70512C16BC6E88D19BAF13A5F557",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "tadi makan siang 25 ribu",
    "isGroupMsg": false
  },
  "webhook_id": "9455fbeb-3a49-4b6c-afe3-0f3016191a2b"
}

### 4a. ciphertext: penanda sementara yang datang SEBELUM pesan aslinya dengan id yang SAMA.
###     Diabaikan (204, tanpa baris). Bila disimpan, pesan asli di 4b dibuang sebagai "duplikat".
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ts": 1791151893567,
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "97ec91b8-53b2-4939-97ce-beef2211c200",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_AC414FE0D9E5F4B9E1A2233E20CE435A",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "ciphertext",
    "body": "",
    "isGroupMsg": false
  },
  "webhook_id": "d38742ae-a9b7-4891-8fd7-e766683f512a"
}

### 4b. Pesan asli dengan id yang sama dengan 4a: 204, satu baris baru berisi teks aslinya, satu job.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ts": 1791151894127,
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "e8c29edf-16fb-482c-ac90-7b3309576f5b",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_AC414FE0D9E5F4B9E1A2233E20CE435A",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "beli bensin 50 ribu",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "sender": { "phoneNumber": "628123456789@c.us", "lid": "111111111111111@lid" }
  },
  "webhook_id": "d38742ae-a9b7-4891-8fd7-e766683f512a"
}

### 5. Aturan 6: fromMe true harus diabaikan. 204, tanpa baris, tanpa job.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "true_111111111111111@lid_3EB0DA8EF10DF6862A67CA",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": true,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "Tercatat: makan siang Rp25.000",
    "isGroupMsg": false
  }
}

### 6. Pesan grup diabaikan sepenuhnya. 204, tanpa baris.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_120363000000000001@g.us_AC414FE0D9E5F4B9E1A2233E20CE435A_111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "120363000000000001@g.us",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "ini pesan dari grup",
    "isGroupMsg": true
  }
}

### 7. onAck (status kirim) diabaikan. 204.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "event": "onAck",
  "data": { "id": "3EB0DA8EF10DF6862A67CA", "ack": 2, "fromMe": true, "type": "chat" }
}

### 8. Event yang belum dikenal diabaikan dengan 204, dan namanya dicatat di log level info
###    (cara mengetahui nama event status sesi v4). data boleh berupa apa saja.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "session", "event": "onStateChanged", "data": "CONFLICT" }

### ============================================================
### Demo idempotency: satu pesan, dua kiriman, satu transaksi
### ============================================================

# Prasyarat: API + worker + Redis menyala, @senderPhone sudah ditautkan ke akun demo (whatsapp.http).
# Balasan bot tiba di WhatsApp nomor itu 2-5 detik setelah tiap pesan yang DIPROSES (jeda antrean outbound).
# Tanpa `t`/`timestamp`, waktu pesan = waktu diterima server, jadi tanggalnya hari ini.
#
# Hasil yang diharapkan (npx prisma studio -> message_logs, atau GET /transactions?q=makan malam):
#   9a  204  message_logs +1 baris, satu job, SATU balasan konfirmasi ("Balas YA untuk simpan ...")
#   9b  204  message_logs tetap; tidak ada job, tidak ada balasan kedua
#   9c  204  message_logs +1 baris; transaksi Rp40.000 tersimpan, balasan "Tersimpan: ..."
#   9d  204  message_logs tetap; transaksi tetap SATU, tidak ada balasan kedua
#            (tanpa unique index, "ya" kedua tetap tidak menggandakan transaksi karena pending sudah
#            terhapus dan transaksi dijaga source_message_id, tetapi bot membalas lagi
#            "Tidak ada transaksi yang menunggu konfirmasi" dan message_logs bertambah)

### 9a. "makan malam 40 ribu" (pertama kali) -> konfirmasi
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "demo-{{demoRun}}-a",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_DEMO{{demoRun}}A",
    "from": "111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "makan malam 40 ribu",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "sender": {
      "phoneNumber": "{{senderPhone}}@c.us",
      "lid": "111111111111111@lid"
    }
  }
}

### 9b. Kirim ulang 9a PERSIS sama (OpenWA at-least-once): tetap 204, tanpa efek apa pun
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "demo-{{demoRun}}-a",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_DEMO{{demoRun}}A",
    "from": "111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "makan malam 40 ribu",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "sender": {
      "phoneNumber": "{{senderPhone}}@c.us",
      "lid": "111111111111111@lid"
    }
  }
}

### 9c. "ya" (pesan baru, data.id berbeda) -> transaksi tersimpan
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "demo-{{demoRun}}-b",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_DEMO{{demoRun}}B",
    "from": "111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "ya",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "sender": {
      "phoneNumber": "{{senderPhone}}@c.us",
      "lid": "111111111111111@lid"
    }
  }
}

### 9d. Kirim ulang 9c PERSIS sama: 204, transaksi tetap satu
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "session",
  "id": "demo-{{demoRun}}-b",
  "event": "onMessage",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_111111111111111@lid_DEMO{{demoRun}}B",
    "from": "111111111111111@lid",
    "chatId": "111111111111111@lid",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "ya",
    "isGroupMsg": false,
    "sender": {
      "phoneNumber": "{{senderPhone}}@c.us",
      "lid": "111111111111111@lid"
    }
  }
}

### ============================================================
### Error
### ============================================================

### Error 401: rahasia di path salah. Tidak ada efek, juga untuk payload yang valid.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/rahasia-yang-salah-sama-sekali
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "session", "event": "onMessage", "data": {} }

### Error 400: body bukan JSON yang valid (rahasia benar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ ini bukan json

### Error 400: JSON valid tetapi bukan amplop OpenWA (tanpa event)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "session", "data": {} }

### Error 400: event onMessage dengan data yang bukan pesan (tanpa id, chatId, type, fromMe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "session", "event": "onMessage", "data": { "body": "tanpa id" } }
